      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/View_Park%E2%80%93Windsor_Hills%2C_California",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Development began in 1923 by the Los Angeles Investment Company, the same firm that built Hancock Park.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
